---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Page
	title="DMCA Policy"
	description="ProofNews DMCA copyright policy: how to report alleged copyright infringement."
	eyebrow="Legal"
>
	<p>
		ProofNews respects the intellectual property rights of others and complies with the Digital
		Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA). If you believe that content on this website infringes your
		copyright, you may request its removal by sending us a notice with the information below.
	</p>

	<h2>Filing a Takedown Notice</h2>
	<p>Your notice must include:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Identification of the copyrighted work you claim has been infringed (or a representative
			list, if multiple works are involved).
		</li>
		<li>
			Identification of the allegedly infringing material, including the specific URL(s) on
			ProofNews.biz.id where it appears.
		</li>
		<li>
			Your full name, address, telephone number, and email address so we can contact you.
		</li>
		<li>
			A statement that you have a good-faith belief that the disputed use is not authorized by
			the copyright owner, its agent, or the law.
		</li>
		<li>
			A statement, made under penalty of perjury, that the information in your notice is accurate
			and that you are the copyright owner or authorized to act on the owner's behalf.
		</li>
		<li>Your physical or electronic signature.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Send notices to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the
		subject line "DMCA Takedown Notice".
	</p>

	<h2>Counter-Notices</h2>
	<p>
		If you believe material was removed in error, you may send a counter-notice containing your
		contact information, identification of the removed material, a statement under penalty of
		perjury that you have a good-faith belief the material was removed by mistake, and your
		consent to the jurisdiction of your local federal court.
	</p>

	<h2>Repeat Infringers</h2>
	<p>
		We reserve the right to remove content and restrict access for users who repeatedly infringe
		the intellectual property rights of others.
	</p>

	<h2>Our Own Content</h2>
	<p>
		All original text published on ProofNews is our own. Photography is sourced from
		<a href="https://unsplash.com" rel="noopener">Unsplash</a> under its license, unless otherwise
		credited. If you are a photographer who believes your work has been misattributed, please
		contact us and we will correct it promptly.
	</p>
</Page>
